==English==

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|la|cōnstituēns}}, present participle of {{m|la|cōnstituō|t=I establish}}, from {{m|la|com-|t=together}} + {{m|la|statuo|t=I set, place, establish}}; see [[statute]] or [[statue]], and compare [[institute]] and [[restitute]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/kənˈstɪtjuənt/|/kənˈstɪt͡ʃuənt/}}
* {{audio|en|en-uk-constituent.ogg|a=UK}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-constituent.ogg|a=US}}
{{wikipedia}}

